                <alias key='&quot;Number of people trained by the National Society in first aid&quot;' value='Number of people reached by the National Society with training in first aid' />
                <alias key='&quot;Percentage of people surveyed who report receiving useful and actionable information&quot;' value='Percentange of those surveyed report receiving useful and actionable information' />
